RequestRedeem_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── when caller requests redeem with sufficient liquidity
│  ├── it should burn shares (instant path)
│  └── it should set totalAssets to zero
├── when receiver is zero
│  └── it should revert with ZeroReceiver
├── when receiver is the vault itself
│  └── it should revert with SelfReceiverNotAllowed
├── when shares is zero
│  └── it should revert with SharesAmountZero
├── when caller is not the shares owner
│  └── it should revert with NotSharesOwner
└── when shares > owner balance
   └── it should revert with InsufficientShares
